{"ref":"BDB, רֹ֫גֶז","hw":"רֹ֫גֶז","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֹ֫גֶז</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong><sup><a data-ref=\"Job 3:26\" href=\"/Job.3.26\">Jb 3:26</a></sup> <strong>agitation, excitement, raging</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:2\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.2\">Hb 3:2</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Job 37:2\" href=\"/Job.37.2\">Jb 37:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָגְזֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.3\">Is 14:3</a>;—<em>raging</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:17\" href=\"/Job.3.17\">Jb 3:17</a>; <em>disquiet, turmoil</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.3\">Is 14:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:26\" href=\"/Job.3.26\">Jb 3:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:1\" href=\"/Job.14.1\">14:1</a>; <em>raging, wrath</em> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:2\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.2\">Hb 3:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ קֹלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:2\" href=\"/Job.37.2\">Jb 37:2</a> <em>rumbling of his voice</em> (i.e. thunder); of <em>excitement</em> of warhorse, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרַעַשׁ וְרֹגֶז</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:24\" href=\"/Job.39.24\">39:24</a>.","next":"BDB, רָגְזָה","prev":"BDB, רָגַז"}